{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_026_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65fc65eca90d864600013507f4f191a868e3b82966d19af40ede6562e7ff0b2a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38d0be16b74ca84d5956f792cc425ce63b14ce6e0f84e9d4f3653a2d6d3f9c78",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，\n在离开这里之前能耽误你一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44ed6d78c8b7c125cb59b5dbe982e7748ddbea3d3ee91cee080268eae5849102",
      "text": "刚才收到的巧克力，\n我想向你当面道谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef2bacc96991c1d7def6e7c45d9aa9e36bf4f49e1d58d2eeb864cba16265eacc",
      "text": "再次感谢你今年也准备了\n如此充满干劲的巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e50588cdad0b086468d3da40e1c79abf4eca7456775d0edd4567875907a33d6e",
      "text": "自从开始从番长这里收到巧克力后，\n我对情人节这种节日的印象就改变了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f58ae443ff7832d4475bb208e4724536aba4f70d1632ca0e05d0ef06c3722be",
      "text": "以前我一直以为这跟我们不良少年是毫无关系的活动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a431c870938cb3c5fd3cbeb6c50e6f65a43e7884a0ace13515a0180a2ffd6a",
      "text": "但情人节，原来是一个向重要的人\n传达热切心意的日子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b990dd4fd0b5d00b64a18f62b47c01ec610959db60ea7d915c48df66eea58c73",
      "text": "你能这么想我很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000045:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e011a9862d766f57716b52cb7d46e049f3a7e17ad7184f25b66808cab7e86aa",
      "text": "今年我也倾注了滚烫的热情哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d399e8ae03f9c805e6ead4f96330f6defa52914b6875bd044e6f13be45afa261",
      "text": "嗯。能让我产生这样的想法，\n也是多亏了番长的那份热烈啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4463b3cf5293beb77351568028cd1e71d8eb7f7870d884406aecc424c138a55",
      "text": "白色情人节的时候，我也打算拿出不输给你的\n干劲全力以赴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_026_23:5_01_026_23_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ec501b4df49e4f95b4495c5bc9ed99c034711239365dc5c0c2e4544eef6413f",
      "text": "回礼，就请满怀期待地等着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
